+def _load_proquest_aliases():
+    """PROQUESTPDF-v1 answer 2: ProQuest names its outlets its own way ("The Center Square; Washington"); the sheet holds the NewsBank form
+    ("Center Square California, The"). proquest_outlets.json (next to this file; built by the Update station's tools/build_pq_aliases.py) lists
+    ProQuest-name -> tracker-name pairs. Each becomes an alias here, so the save's same-outlet and reprint checks read a ProQuest name and the
